Cell["\<\
Create the framework for agents and the environment. We shouldn\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t expect to have a small scale simulation at this point, \
just a cohesive framework for agents and the environment and how they will \
work. (How will the agents interact with the environment? What will the first \
few rules be?)\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.9326408287651653`*^9}, {
