Cell["\<\
We will know that we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve accomplished the goals for Sprint 1 \
when we have rulesets for more of the basic elements of the model like \
survival and movement. We shouldn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t have rulesets for more \
complex behavior like parenting and reproduction yet. We should also have \
specific research and rationales backing up our ruleset coming from prior \
research or evolutionary game theory.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.932640858440374*^9}, {
  3.932640893654585*^9, 3.932640924125202*^9}, {3.9782879100732193`*^9, 
  3.9782879344516983`*^9}, {3.978526985643154*^9, 
  3.978527044303074*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3d567ec8-b520-45b0-a847-\
0069d05f1c5d"]
}, Open  ]],

