Cell["\<\
We will know that we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve accomplished the goals for Sprint 3 \
when our simulation has distinct agent behaviors based on the genes we \
create, and we can track the prevalence, success, and spread of those genes. \
At this point we can begin to test the waters of agent behavior by tweaking \
parameters slightly. Our simulation should be stable at this point (no crazy \
behavior, population explosions, etc.). Ideally some of our parameter \
configurations would lead to equilibrium in terms of population and \
gene-makeup at this point.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.932640858440374*^9}, {
   3.932640893654585*^9, 3.932640924125202*^9}, {3.9782879100732193`*^9, 
