Cell["\<\
Everybody. Visualization is a complex task, but Shreraj can specialize in \
grid representation, food visualization, and agent movement. Will be 2D. Yash \
and Om can specialize in other agent animations (eating, reproducing, \
parenting)\
\>", "Subsubitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.9326408287651653`*^9}, {
  3.9782877671221943`*^9, 3.978287786493078*^9}, {3.9782879445852833`*^9, 
