  3.978527877664562*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"28f00a85-15dd-e644-9635-\
675beadbef56"],

Cell["\<\
For the visualization, we were thinking of some kind of grid made up of \
discrete squares in which agents are represented by little squares or circles \
moving around on the grid. Food will also be a square or circle on the grid. \
Picture the google snake game, but the snake doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t grow \
longer as it eats more and occupies 1 square at a time, while food exists on \
squares throughout the world. We could also make the environment continuous \
instead of just being a grid if we have time.\
\>", "Subsubitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.9326408287651653`*^9}, {
  3.9782877671221943`*^9, 3.978287786493078*^9}, {3.9782879445852833`*^9, 
