Cell["\<\
We will know that we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve accomplished the goals for Sprint 4 \
when we can clearly see our simulation playing out, along with graphs and \
stats on the side of the simulation that match up with \
what\[CloseCurlyQuote]s going on. Before this point, we would have just had \
graphs and data being exported (or updated and shown real time), but at this \
point we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll be able to see a visual representation side by \
side with these graphs.\
\>", "Item",
