Cell["\<\
Conduct experiments. We can simulate famines, overpopulation, seasonal \
variation, and other constraining events. Om can simulate these events. IVs \
will be parameters and DVs will be gene success (advantageous strategies). \
Yash and Shreraj can run the experiments and collect data.\
\>", "Subsubitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93264082576614*^9, 3.9326408287651653`*^9}, {
